e their own MOOC offerings and to make physically attending university more attractive, by augmenting existing teaching.", "reference": "2013 July 20, “The attack of the MOOCs”, in The Economist, volume 408, number 8845, archived from the original on 04 Apr 2021:"}, {"text": "The most compelling stories of whether university is worth it are examples where a university education lifts the economic standing of a poor or disadvantaged student to a higher socioeconomic position.", "reference": "2021, Harvey P. Weingarten, “Is Going to University Worth It?”, in Nothing Less than Great: Reforming Canada’s Universities, Toronto, Ont.; Buffalo, N.Y.; London: University of Toronto Press, →ISBN, page 23:"}, {"text": "The NIAID supports projects at universities and research organizations around the United States as well as a network of 21 NIAID labs across the country.", "reference": "2023 August 2, Ben Tinker, Meg Tirrell and Brenda Goodman, “New director named at National Institute of Allergy and Infectious Diseases after Fauci’s retirement”, in CNN, archived from the original on 13 Jul 2025:"}], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [{"language": {"code": "af", "name": "Afrikaans"}, "word": "universiteit"}, {"language": {"code": "sq", "name": "Albanian"}, "word": "fakulltet"}, {"language": {"code": "sq", "name": "Albanian"}, "word": "universitet"}, {"language": {"code": "am", "name": "Amharic"}, "word": "ዩኒቨርሲቲ"}, {"language": {"code": "ar", "name": "Arabic"}, "word": "جَامِعَة"}, {"language": {"code": "arq", "name": "Algerian Arabic"}, "word": "جَامِيعَة"}, {"language": {"code": "arz", "name": "Arabic"}, "word": "جامعة"}, {"language": {"code": "afb", "name": "Arabic"}, "word": "جامعة"}, {"language": {"code": "acw", "name": "Arabic"}, "word": "جامْعة"}, {"language": {"code": "pga", "name": "Juba Arabic"}, "word": "jama"}, {"language": {"code": "apd", "name": "Sudanese Arabic"}, "word": "جامعة"}, {"language": {"code": "an", "name": "Aragonese"}, "word": "universida